title: "TDA on financial time series: regime change detection"
abstract: "Persistent homology over sliding windows of multi-asset returns, tested against realised volatility and the leading eigenvalue of the correlation matrix on leakage-free folds (purged walk-forward, leave-one-crisis-out). Version 0.1.0 records the analysis plan, fixed before any result."
